{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsYBQ1My55hU1G7MXhoH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012esAZa2oRrG7y76WH4E4SC","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t06/primary/exec-ws/derivations.md","content":"# W371 derivations for e6-t06 (first derivation, node resolve-local)\n\nMethod: per spec.md, weights cycle 3, 7, 1 assigned to the payload digits\nfrom RIGHT to LEFT — the rightmost payload digit always has weight 3, the\nnext digit leftward 7, the next 1, then the cycle repeats. S = sum of\ndigit x weight over the payload. Check digit c = (10 - (S mod 10)) mod 10.\nAn identifier is VALID iff its final digit equals c of the payload before it.\n\nFor a 7-digit payload the weights read LEFT to RIGHT are [3,1,7,3,1,7,3];\nfor a 6-digit payload they are [1,7,3,1,7,3]. (Both derived from the\nright-to-left rule; stated only to make the tables below checkable.)\n\n## Validate items (8-digit identifier = 7-digit payload + check digit)\n\n### 66373197 — payload 6637319, final digit 7\ndigit x weight (left to right): 6x3=18, 6x1=6, 3x7=21, 7x3=21, 3x1=3, 1x7=7, 9x3=27\nS = 18+6+21+21+3+7+27 = 103; S mod 10 = 3; c = (10-3) mod 10 = 7.\nc = 7 equals final digit 7 -> VALID\n\n### 74193967 — payload 7419396, final digit 7\n7x3=21, 4x1=4, 1x7=7, 9x3=27, 3x1=3, 9x7=63, 6x3=18\nS = 21+4+7+27+3+63+18 = 143; S mod 10 = 3; c = 7.\nc = 7 equals final digit 7 -> VALID\n\n### 92489881 — payload 9248988, final digit 1\n9x3=27, 2x1=2, 4x7=28, 8x3=24, 9x1=9, 8x7=56, 8x3=24\nS = 27+2+28+24+9+56+24 = 170; S mod 10 = 0; c = (10-0) mod 10 = 0.\nc = 0 differs from final digit 1 -> INVALID\n\n### 52874804 — payload 5287480, final digit 4\n5x3=15, 2x1=2, 8x7=56, 7x3=21, 4x1=4, 8x7=56, 0x3=0\nS = 15+2+56+21+4+56+0 = 154; S mod 10 = 4; c = 6.\nc = 6 differs from final digit 4 -> INVALID\n\n### 74391491 — payload 7439149, final digit 1\n7x3=21, 4x1=4, 3x7=21, 9x3=27, 1x1=1, 4x7=28, 9x3=27\nS = 21+4+21+27+1+28+27 = 129; S mod 10 = 9; c = 1.\nc = 1 equals final digit 1 -> VALID\n\n### 91324575 — payload 9132457, final digit 5\n9x3=27, 1x1=1, 3x7=21, 2x3=6, 4x1=4, 5x7=35, 7x3=21\nS = 27+1+21+6+4+35+21 = 115; S mod 10 = 5; c = 5.\nc = 5 equals final digit 5 -> VALID\n\n### 15878375 — payload 1587837, final digit 5\n1x3=3, 5x1=5, 8x7=56, 7x3=21, 8x1=8, 3x7=21, 7x3=21\nS = 3+5+56+21+8+21+21 = 135; S mod 10 = 5; c = 5.\nc = 5 equals final digit 5 -> VALID\n\n### 29067655 — payload 2906765, final digit 5\n2x3=6, 9x1=9, 0x7=0, 6x3=18, 7x1=7, 6x7=42, 5x3=15\nS = 6+9+0+18+7+42+15 = 97; S mod 10 = 7; c = 3.\nc = 3 differs from final digit 5 -> INVALID\n\n## Compute items (6-digit payloads)\n\n### 479812\n4x1=4, 7x7=49, 9x3=27, 8x1=8, 1x7=7, 2x3=6\nS = 4+49+27+8+7+6 = 101; S mod 10 = 1; c = 9.\n\n### 153886\n1x1=1, 5x7=35, 3x3=9, 8x1=8, 8x7=56, 6x3=18\nS = 1+35+9+8+56+18 = 127; S mod 10 = 7; c = 3.\n\n### 278381\n2x1=2, 7x7=49, 8x3=24, 3x1=3, 8x7=56, 1x3=3\nS = 2+49+24+3+56+3 = 137; S mod 10 = 7; c = 3.\n\n### 027899\n0x1=0, 2x7=14, 7x3=21, 8x1=8, 9x7=63, 9x3=27\nS = 0+14+21+8+63+27 = 133; S mod 10 = 3; c = 7.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1330,"cache_read_input_tokens":34654,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1330},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88588d8b-8ac9-4fb9-b1ee-44983eb3f8e6","uuid":"1250984b-c550-4d53-9992-644d500f62a5","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:06:38.413Z","request_id":"req_011CdsYBN2o9sMkYVRTwd1yB"}
