{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsYP8U4KzaZa3mvpTaSN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stage S6 for e6-t06 is complete. The harness is the `local-independent-verify` family, so I executed the three in-session nodes and left `verify-independent` and `return-result` to the root harness.\n\n**Answers (first derivation, spec-faithful W371 — weights 3,7,1 right-to-left, rightmost payload digit = 3):**\n\n| Item | Answer |\n|---|---|\n| validate:66373197 | VALID (S=103, c=7) |\n| validate:74193967 | VALID (S=143, c=7) |\n| validate:92489881 | INVALID (c=0 vs final 1) |\n| validate:52874804 | INVALID (c=6 vs final 4) |\n| validate:74391491 | VALID (S=129, c=1) |\n| validate:91324575 | VALID (S=115, c=5) |\n| validate:15878375 | VALID (S=135, c=5) |\n| validate:29067655 | INVALID (c=3 vs final 5) |\n| compute:479812 / 153886 / 278381 / 027899 | 9 / 3 / 3 / 7 |\n\n**What each node produced:**\n- **observe-evidence** — read all governed materials (spec, items, distinctions, contract, harness).\n- **resolve-local** — full per-item weighted-sum tables in `derivations.md`, the deliverable `result.json` (answers + method, satisfying E-A), and `resolution.json`.\n- **verify-resolution** (read-only, non-authoritative) — re-checked all 12 items via the congruence form (valid iff S + final digit ≡ 0 mod 10) with re-tabulated sums; all agreed, and `result.json` matches the deliverable shape.\n\n**Resolution status:** Q1 and Q2 are RESOLVED by resolve-local. Q3 stays UNRESOLVED — its E-B evidence requires a re-derivation causally separated from my working context, which this session cannot admissibly produce; it is assigned to the root-executed examiner via `examiner-charge.md` (proposed in the ledger), which prescribes a disjoint method (full-sum congruence check; left-to-right weighting with explicit phase correction), forbids reading `derivations.md`, and directs extra scrutiny at the three INVALID verdicts and the four computed digits. Q4 stays UNRESOLVED because E-C satisfaction is decided by deterministic root verification; my passing cross-check is recorded as supporting evidence only.\n\nAll deliverables are written: `result.json`, `resolution.json`, `evidence.json` (ev-1…ev-4), `execution-ledger.jsonl` (five events in dependency order, node events labeled per primitive, charge under a creator `propose`), plus `derivations.md` and `examiner-charge.md`. Per protocol, my session ends after that propose event."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1108,"cache_read_input_tokens":50497,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1108},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88588d8b-8ac9-4fb9-b1ee-44983eb3f8e6","uuid":"a24f3ca2-7edf-400e-81bd-58945f0c86b2","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:07:56.024Z","request_id":"req_011CdsYP6bSbZfhFHDGDYSvK"}
